# Digital Design – Week 1 (Combinational Basics)

## 📌 Description
Practice codes for Week 1 of the Digital Systems Roadmap. Covers combinational logic circuits with truth tables, equations, and Verilog implementations. Each section includes a slot for the corresponding EDA Playground link.

